join detective right
detective: What do you think about the cook?
join friend left
friend: My dearest friend collapsed shortly after eating something prepared by her.
friend (antsy): What do you THINK I think of her?
friend (speaking): She clearly hates her job. She poisoned him, plain and simple.
friend: And when that didn't take him out, she used the stake to finish the job.
friend: Not sure where she would have gotten the stake, though.
friend: Not something you'd expect a chef to have on them.
